## AgySafe delegation

When the user explicitly asks to use AgySafe, AGY, or Antigravity for a task, invoke the installed `agysafe` command from the current project directory.

Default:

```text
agysafe --workspace "." --json "<exact user task>"
```

AgySafe selects mode and model automatically unless the user explicitly requests overrides.

Manual model override:

```text
agysafe --workspace "." --model <slug> --json "<exact user task>"
```

Return the real AgySafe result. Do not repeatedly retry a failed long task. If the receipt says `SNAPSHOT_TOO_LARGE`, report the snapshot size/heaviest roots and recommend `.agysafeignore` or a smaller workspace before increasing timeout.
<!-- AGYSAFE:END -->
